{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18950","headline":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 三 · 刘禹锡","name":"敬宗睿武昭愍孝皇帝挽歌三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"讲学金华殿，亲畊钩盾田。\n侍臣容谏猎，方士信求仙。\n虹影俄侵日，龙髯不上天。\n空余水银海，长照夜灯前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}